<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Seeing Through Words: Controlling Visual Retrieval Quality with Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
